* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pb binary
*.zip binary

# Shell scripts MUST be LF. A CRLF shebang becomes `bash`, which the kernel
# cannot resolve -- the script dies with "No such file or directory" naming an
# interpreter that plainly exists. Copying a script to a Linux host with scp
# bypasses git's normalisation entirely, so this is belt and braces with the
# deploy step's own dos2unix.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
